---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { siteData } from "@/data/site";

const { social, referral, name } = siteData;
---

<PageLayout
	title="About Pinoy Techie"
	description="Pinoy Techie makes plain-language tech and money-app guides for Filipinos. Learn who runs this site, how guides are written and updated, and how referral rewards work."
	lead="Short, honest tech tips and tutorials for Filipinos, starting with MariBank and everyday money apps."
	path="/about/"
	type="AboutPage">
	<h2>Who we are</h2>
	<p>
		{name} makes short tech tips and tutorials for Filipinos. This website is where the longer, searchable version of the
		money-app topics people keep asking about lives, starting with MariBank.
	</p>

	<h2>What you will find here</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Guides</strong>: step-by-step how-tos, such as <a href="/blog/how-to-open-maribank-account/">opening a MariBank account</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Comparisons</strong>: side-by-side looks, such as <a href="/blog/maribank-vs-gcash/">MariBank vs GCash</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Safety checks</strong>: what to verify before you deposit, such as <a href="/blog/is-maribank-legit/">is MariBank legit</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Videos</strong>: the same topics on screen, on our <a href="/videos/">videos page</a>.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How we write and update guides</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Each guide separates what is verified from what changes often, such as savings rates and promo terms.</li>
		<li>Every article shows when it was published and, if it changed, when it was last updated.</li>
		<li>We point you to the official app or regulator for the latest numbers instead of guessing.</li>
		<li>Found a mistake? <a href="/contact/">Tell us</a> and we will correct it and note the update date.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 id="disclosure">Referral disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		This site shares the MariBank referral code <strong>{referral.code}</strong>. New users who sign up with it can receive
		{referral.bonus} after meeting MariBank's deposit conditions. Referral programs usually reward the person who shared the code
		too, so we may earn a reward when you sign up with it.
	</p>
	<p>
		{name} is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by MariBank or Sea Group. MariBank sets and can change the reward
		terms. Nothing on this site is financial advice. Read the full <a href="/disclosure/">referral disclosure</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		{
			social.email ? (
				<>Email <a href={`mailto:${social.email}`}>{social.email}</a>, or visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</>
			) : social.youtube ? (
				<>Message us on <a href={social.youtube} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">YouTube</a>, or visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</>
			) : (
				<>Visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</>
			)
		}
	</p>
</PageLayout>
